{"format":"lognara-metrics","version":1,"metrics":[{"name":"server_lookups","title":"Запросов поиска сервера по имени","description":"NavigatorApiService RPC GetServerByName (серч).","unit":"запросов","kind":"delta","aggregation":"sum","enabled":true,"rule":{"contains":"(\"server_lookups\": ","pattern":"\\(\"server_lookups\": (?P<value>-?\\d+)\\)","value_group":"value"}},{"name":"server_registrations","title":"Регистраций серверов","description":"Регистрация нового сервера на Navigator.","unit":"регистраций","kind":"delta","aggregation":"sum","enabled":true,"rule":{"contains":"(\"server_registrations\": ","pattern":"\\(\"server_registrations\": (?P<value>-?\\d+)\\)","value_group":"value"}},{"name":"grpc_requests_total","title":"Обработанных gRPC-вызовов","description":"Входящий unary-вызов до обработки, общий интерсептор ServerExceptionInterceptor.","unit":"запросов","kind":"delta","aggregation":"sum","enabled":true,"rule":{"contains":"(\"grpc_requests_total\": ","pattern":"\\(\"grpc_requests_total\": (?P<value>-?\\d+)\\)","value_group":"value"}},{"name":"grpc_request_duration_ms_total","title":"Суммарная длительность gRPC-вызовов","description":"Время обработки вызовов (в т.ч. ошибочных), мс.","unit":"мс","kind":"delta","aggregation":"sum","enabled":true,"rule":{"contains":"(\"grpc_request_duration_ms_total\": ","pattern":"\\(\"grpc_request_duration_ms_total\": (?P<value>-?\\d+)\\)","value_group":"value"}},{"name":"grpc_requests_failed","title":"Неудачных gRPC-вызовов (бизнес-ошибка)","description":"BaseGrpcException - осмысленный доменный отказ.","unit":"запросов","kind":"delta","aggregation":"sum","enabled":true,"rule":{"contains":"(\"grpc_requests_failed\": ","pattern":"\\(\"grpc_requests_failed\": (?P<value>-?\\d+)\\)","value_group":"value"}},{"name":"grpc_requests_errors","title":"Ошибок gRPC-вызовов (неожиданная ошибка)","description":"Иное исключение (сбойный баг/инфраструктура).","unit":"запросов","kind":"delta","aggregation":"sum","enabled":true,"rule":{"c